```

The filter buttons iterate over `["all", ...STATUS_ORDER]` (i.e., `all`, `intake`, `fall_checklist`, `storage`, `spring_checklist`, `ready`, `invoiced`, `archived`). Each button shows the status label and a count of cards in that status. Clicking sets the `filter` state, and the cards list is client-side filtered.

