## 10. Checklist Screen Logic (Lines 3496–3604)

**File:** `D:\Desktop\marine\public\index.html`

### Season determination (lines 3497–3504)
```javascript
// CHECKLIST TAB
function ChecklistTab({ card, reload }) {
  const showToast = useContext(ToastCtx);
  const season =
    card.status === "spring_checklist" || card.status === "ready"
      ? "spring"
      : "fall";
  const [activeList, setActiveList] = useState(season);
  const CHECKLISTS = { fall: FALL_CHECKLIST, spring: SPRING_CHECKLIST };
```

**Key rule:** If `card.status` is `"spring_checklist"` or `"ready"`, the active checklist defaults to `"spring"`. For any other status (`intake`, `fall_checklist`, `storage`, `invoiced`, `archived`), it defaults to `"fall"`.

